<title>USA: Intl Lottery names David Nichols president.</title>
<headline>Intl Lottery names David Nichols president.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Lottery Inc on Thursday said David Nichols has been appointed president.</p>
<p>Nichols replaces Edmund Turek, the company's founder, who was named vice chairman of International Lottery.</p>
<p>Nichols was senior vice president of sales. He previously served as the company's vice president of operations.</p>
<p>Interlott designs, manufactures, sells, leases and services dispensing machines for the lottery, telecommunications and financial services industries.</p>
</text>
